{
 "id": "split/volatile-in-first-message",
 "description": "The variant issue 567 could not measure: the volatile snapshot changes inside message 0, which a messages[0] breakpoint hashes. The provider reads through system (2,500 tokens) and writes the other 8,000. The client made the change, so the break has an empty ChangeID and, with B* at the system breakpoint, no priced tokens. The 8,000 written tokens are the room an operator that moved that breakpoint could win back, but they are not a cost of any operation.",
 "source": "issue_cases.md#567",
